From bc8917e8b9c0d56a241b43418bac0d5120cc7746 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 21:22:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(auth): remove open POST /api/auth/register endpoint

Account creation is only via /api/onboarding, which is Turnstile-verified.
The unauthenticated /auth/register route accepted any organizationId and
role from the caller and was never used by the frontend, so a bot that
found it could bypass the signup bot check entirely.

- drop route, controller method and frontend api wrapper
- replace the register tests with one asserting 404
- drop /auth/register from the axios 401 interceptor check

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017cwWQVC5ZEop97pT2PfCPv
